                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6284ad63-3736-3239-bf9b-03efcefc8464",
                        "entry_id": "06d0ae88-0267-31ee-8cac-54496c51f527",
                        "glosses": [
                            "(männliche^☆) Person, die ihr sexuelles Interesse auf eine Person unabhängig vom Geschlecht richtet"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6d06e9d2-a77c-43bc-bb4c-e5110c379b13",
                        "source_entry_id": "06d0ae88-0267-31ee-8cac-54496c51f527",
                        "source_sense_id": "6284ad63-3736-3239-bf9b-03efcefc8464",
                        "source_sense_description": "(männliche) Person, die ihr sexuelles Interesse auf eine Person unabhängig vom Geschlecht richtet",
                        "target_lang_word": "pansexual",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pansexual",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8251a244-e34e-3464-9797-6b178eb05b05",
                                        "entry_id": "c3d90f71-9850-3d6f-aee7-3bf1e13fd1de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sexually attracted to people regardless of gender."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01e77014-8e30-4354-be02-7391ea6b3ff5",
                                                "sense_id": "8251a244-e34e-3464-9797-6b178eb05b05",
                                                "text": "Karen and Carlos are definitely pansexual people who have paired off to have this child, and this seems real and good to them now. When I had been with Karen, she had floated through several gay relationships, […] all my friends had been what I would call pansexual, avoiding the older term bisexual, which is meaningless when you can count more than two sexes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "072f8c31-855b-44e7-8a86-f5dbf43e49ba",
                                                "sense_id": "8251a244-e34e-3464-9797-6b178eb05b05",
                                                "text": "Obviously many women who answered the survey considered themselves bisexual in the past no longer do. Perceiving oneself as bisexual was often a stage of transition between heterosexuality and homosexuality. But others did consider and still consider themselves bisexual. Here are some stories of bisexual or pansexual women and some comments about [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50d02acc-9243-4f90-99e4-7ee61717683e",
                                                "sense_id": "8251a244-e34e-3464-9797-6b178eb05b05",
                                                "text": "As a writer/sexologist, he argues that people are neither homosexual nor heterosexual but pansexual."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64629f75-2f04-48ee-8a46-43d042773154",
                                                "sense_id": "8251a244-e34e-3464-9797-6b178eb05b05",
                                                "text": "CUMMING: Bisexual, I suppose... No, pansexual. Some bloke in a newspaper called me a \"frolicky pansexual sex symbol for the new millennium.\" I thought that was fabulous."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76b1d3e2-7e93-3ea2-bbb6-2a2bc3ea4c2e",
                                        "entry_id": "c3d90f71-9850-3d6f-aee7-3bf1e13fd1de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sexually attracted to everyone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb3910f6-f254-4a3a-b436-baa0ea0d097f",
                                                "sense_id": "76b1d3e2-7e93-3ea2-bbb6-2a2bc3ea4c2e",
                                                "text": "To the end he [Walt Whitman] denied that he was homosexual; his writings are pansexual, finding carnal ripeness in the soul, in nature, as well as in men and women."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "971ac40b-5ad7-362e-aff4-3ee9e1076f96",
                                        "entry_id": "c3d90f71-9850-3d6f-aee7-3bf1e13fd1de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Welcoming people of all sexual orientations."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90647cd3-d2d9-4bca-9b32-b2e58b487ca2",
                                                "sense_id": "971ac40b-5ad7-362e-aff4-3ee9e1076f96",
                                                "text": "We like to attend pansexual group sex parties, which means that attendees may identify as gay or lesbian or bisexual or hetero or transgendered, but are generally comfortable and happy to play side-by-side with people whose desires may be entirely different than their own."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d7586a3-6736-39e2-b08b-27f05a6dcbdd",
                                        "entry_id": "c3d90f71-9850-3d6f-aee7-3bf1e13fd1de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to the psychological theory of pansexualism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "pansexual",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
